  "description": "Welcome to your new sanctuary in one of Butler's most convenient and family-friendly neighborhoods. Positioned directly opposite scenic parklands, this bright, light-filled 3-bedroom, 2-bathroom home offers the ideal combination of space, modern functionality and easy coastal living.<br/><br/>At the heart of the residence is a stylish open-plan kitchen designed for effortless daily living and entertaining. Cooking is a breeze with premium features including a stainless steel oven, gas cooktop, dishwasher and a sleek stainless steel range hood, complemented by a breakfast bar and ample storage with upper cabinetry.<br/><br/>The accommodation offers privacy and comfort for the whole family. The main bedroom serves as your own personal retreat, complete with a private ensuite, custom walk-in robe and split-system air conditioning. The two secondary bedrooms are generously sized with built-in robes and their own wall-mounted air conditioners. Allergy sufferers and busy lifestyles will appreciate the carpet-free floors throughout for easy care. The primary bathroom features a full separate bathtub and a dedicated separate toilet, while a large laundry provides extra storage with a linen cupboard and upper cabinets.<br/><br/>Step outside to your outdoor covered alfresco patio-the perfect venue for hosting guests or unwinding after a long day. Synthetic lawns at both the front and rear mean you enjoy vibrant green spaces year-round with zero mowing required. Complete with a double remote garage for secure parking, this home delivers true low-maintenance living without compromising on space.<br/><br/>Enjoy an unbeatable lifestyle location with everything you need right on your doorstep:<br/>800m* to the local train station<br/>900m* to Butler Central Shopping Precinct<br/>1.9km* to beautiful Jindee Beach<br/>Steps to nearby schools, parks, and local amenities<br/><br/>*** ARE YOU A LANDLORD? If you are looking for property management services, we would love to hear from you. Contact our Business Development Manager Ervina on 0430 705 375 or edeng@harcourtsps.com.au for a no-obligation and confidential conversation.",
